-- title:
--   Verified Boolean seed family for exponent $2.13981$
-- statement:
--   For every integer $m\ge0$, there exist an input dimension $n$ and a total Boolean function $f:\{0,1\}^n\to\{0,1\}$ whose sensitivity $s(f)$ and block sensitivity $bs(f)$ satisfy
--
--   $$
--   16^m\le s(f)\le 10^{15}\,10121928^m,
--   \qquad (5591^4)^m\le bs(f).
--   $$
--
--   The fixed prefactor $10^{15}$ bounds the initial profile constant. These explicit exponential seed bounds, together with the strict logarithmic gap, imply the claimed asymptotic sensitivity exponent.
